#WonderBoy #MonsterWorld #RpgMaker #Jrpg #RetroGames

(subtitles available)

Hello everyone! 
Presenting here some gameplay of Monster World RPG, we take on Pagoda Castle, one of the dungeons from the second chapter.

Not only a playthrough to help you complete this area, but in here we also explain how several options and systems in the game work, so players can know their options, and what to expect when it comes to challenges

We hope you have lots of fun with the game!

